		{"id":"687bd42a4ee8abfe","type":"file","file":"LLM/2-Source/7-Deep Learning/1-Pytorch/0-张量的基础操作.md","x":2417,"y":3775,"width":400,"height":400,"color":"3"},
		{
			"id":"c6f6ad0d4f82c744",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"optim.SGD",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1358,
			"y":4486,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"7f715f87fee4daf3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"数据集总计训练了多少轮次",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1358,
			"y":4567,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"3ecd1961f91c7edc",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"外层是进行多少个epoch",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1697,
			"y":4567,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"f508157e2408ead2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"有多少批, 总计就会循环多少次",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1697,
			"y":4667,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"8964fa76e20a0f52",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"内层是分了多少批",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1358,
			"y":4727,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"91541b1cac2546f2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"```\n\t# 训练模型，预测结果（注意类型转换） \n\ty_pred = model(train_x.type(torch.float32)) \n\t\n\t# 计算损失（注意类型转换） \n\tloss = loss_fn(y_pred, train_y.reshape(-1,1).type(torch.float32)) \n\t# 反向传播，更新参数 \n\toptimizer.zero_grad() # 清空梯度 \n\tloss.backward() # 反向传播 \n\toptimizer.step() # 更新参数\n```",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1638,
			"y":4807,
			"width":420,
			"height":362,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"021c22cb2a0c5e15",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"开启两层循环",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1018,
			"y":4627,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"a2c16554d7bac0d6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"评估",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1018,
			"y":4837,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"40003f0521023008",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"DataLoader",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1354,
			"y":4167,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"1822363ecaad55ac",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"model = nn.Linear(in_features=1, out_features=1)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1358,
			"y":4261,
			"width":260,
			"height":106,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"5df653a97de920eb",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"nn.MSELoss()",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1358,
			"y":4396,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"fbc5a90c414f9d42",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"模型训练:\n3 + 2 + 5\n3:\n\t3个定义:\n\t\t第一个定义模型\n\t\t第二个定义损失函数\n\t\t第三个定义优化器\n2:\n\t2个遍历:\n\t\t外层遍历轮次,内层遍历批次\n5:\n\t\t前向传播\n\t\t损失计算\n\t\t梯度清零\n\t\t反向传播\n\t\t参数更新",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":692,
			"y":4036,
			"width":260,
			"height":450,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"a5a235e1be2b823b",
